# Old netlify.app links (shared before the custom domain existed) forward
# permanently to the primary domain. Browsers carry the #v1=… settings
# fragment across the redirect, so shared vision links keep working.
https://vssimulator.netlify.app/* https://vssimulator.com/:splat 301!
http://vssimulator.netlify.app/*  https://vssimulator.com/:splat 301!
